266
00:15:16.332 --> 00:15:18.418
Well, we know each other, right?

267
00:15:18.501 --> 00:15:20.753
Then can you

268
00:15:20.837 --> 00:15:25.425
Help my husband get in touch
Allow him to talk to the other party in person?

269
00:15:25.508 --> 00:15:27.009
Did you ask him for help?

270
00:15:27.802 --> 00:15:30.346
Yeah, I'm thinking

271
00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:32.223
You have enough trouble in the company

272
00:15:32.306 --> 00:15:34.267
That's why I'm helping you

273
00:15:35.268 --> 00:15:36.769
Does this also hurt your self-esteem?

274
00:15:38.479 --> 00:15:40.398
Hello Kim Nak Soo

275
00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:43.276
Oh my god

276
00:15:43.359 --> 00:15:46.154
Do you know what your biggest problem is?

277
00:15:48.322 --> 00:15:50.199
You don't know how to be grateful

278
00:15:50.283 --> 00:15:52.493
You always thought you got where you are today on your own

279
00:15:52.577 --> 00:15:54.787
- enough
- You also have a bad personality

280
00:15:54.871 --> 00:15:57.707
Overly sensitive, bad tempered

281
00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.835
You're such a terrible person, Kim Nak-soo.

282
00:16:00.918 --> 00:16:03.546
you went too far

283
00:16:04.422 --> 00:16:06.966
On Sunday, whether it's Executive Bai or the president himself,

284
00:16:07.049 --> 00:16:08.885
I won't do anything

285
00:16:08.968 --> 00:16:09.969
Wife

286
00:16:10.052 --> 00:16:14.182
Whether you want to braise pork ribs or make hand-made noodles

287
00:16:14.807 --> 00:16:16.392
Do it yourself

288
00:16:16.476 --> 00:16:19.437
Wife, you just promised to help me

289
00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.063
When did I say that?

290
00:16:24.066 --> 00:16:26.861
I've done enough

291
00:16:26.944 --> 00:16:31.199
I pulled Soo-gyeom up
I have also done my duty to my husband’s family.

292
00:16:31.282 --> 00:16:34.076
And try your best to maintain your self-esteem

293
00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:35.453
Wife

294
00:16:35.536 --> 00:16:36.704
Our married life...

295
00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.917
Now onto the next chapter

296
00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.126
What are you talking about?

297
00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.127
Got it?

298
00:16:43.211 --> 00:16:46.506
Ouch, you scared me. What are you doing?

299
00:16:47.298 --> 00:16:48.299
Wife!

300
00:16:59.143 --> 00:17:01.062
(ACT Building 1, ACT Building 2)

301
00:17:05.525 --> 00:17:08.069
- Minister Kim...
- Isn’t Minister Kim here yet?

302
00:17:08.736 --> 00:17:10.821
He is rarely late

303
00:17:14.075 --> 00:17:14.951
You're here, Minister Kim.

304
00:17:15.785 --> 00:17:17.286
So heavy

305
00:17:18.621 --> 00:17:20.289
What is all this, Minister?

306
00:17:20.957 --> 00:17:22.875
This is for you Song Hee

307
00:17:23.543 --> 00:17:24.710
And Narihisa

308
00:17:24.794 --> 00:17:26.170
- give
- Wait

309
00:17:26.254 --> 00:17:27.213
Why are you all so surprised?

310
00:17:27.296 --> 00:17:28.214
To Mr. Song

311
00:17:28.297 --> 00:17:29.340
thank you minister

312
00:17:30.383 --> 00:17:31.259
Are you...

313
00:17:32.927 --> 00:17:34.595
Saving points?

314
00:17:34.679 --> 00:17:35.930
What does it mean?

315
00:17:37.139 --> 00:17:39.308
Nothing. Thank you, Minister.

316
00:17:39.392 --> 00:17:40.601
OK...

317
00:17:40.685 --> 00:17:41.602
- Minister Kim
- Huh?

318
00:17:41.686 --> 00:17:42.603
Are you...

319
00:17:44.897 --> 00:17:46.857
- Are you going to resign?
- What are you talking about?

320
00:17:46.941 --> 00:17:49.569
Is it weird for me to buy you a cup of coffee?

321
00:17:49.652 --> 00:17:52.238
- Not surprising
- Thank you Minister

322
00:17:52.321 --> 00:17:53.864
- drink
- thank you

323
00:17:57.451 --> 00:17:59.120
Let's go to the rooftop and talk.

324
00:18:01.831 --> 00:18:03.165
- OK
- I'll put this down first.

325
00:18:03.249 --> 00:18:04.625
- OK
- OK

326
00:18:06.794 --> 00:18:07.878
Let's go out and run some business

327
00:18:14.302 --> 00:18:15.177
Now?

328
00:18:16.846 --> 00:18:20.099
Let’s just call this week “Special Sales Week”

329
00:18:20.182 --> 00:18:23.436
It’s been a while since I’ve been on the front line
Let's try our best to have a big fight

330
00:18:24.103 --> 00:18:27.898
Minister, I still have a lot of work to do.
I can't go out to work now

331
00:18:28.899 --> 00:18:29.775
you...

332
00:18:30.318 --> 00:18:31.777
Do you really have that much work?

333
00:18:32.403 --> 00:18:34.822
Last time you asked us

334
00:18:34.905 --> 00:18:37.491
Come up with five ideas for new products

335
00:18:38.826 --> 00:18:41.787
You can take your time with that one

336
00:18:43.914 --> 00:18:46.834
Minister, shall we go have a cigarette?

337
00:18:46.917 --> 00:18:48.210
I didn't bring cigarettes

338
00:18:48.294 --> 00:18:49.170
I brought it

339
00:18:51.047 --> 00:18:52.757
- Don't talk about me behind my back.
- Come on

340
00:18:56.052 --> 00:18:59.680
You can definitely tell they weren't too happy.

341
00:19:00.222 --> 00:19:01.974
Why is everyone so harsh on me?

342
00:19:02.058 --> 00:19:03.893
What did I do wrong?

343
00:19:03.976 --> 00:19:05.895
It's just like politics

344
00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:08.731
If the support rate is not high, nothing can be accomplished.

345
00:19:08.814 --> 00:19:10.232
I'm on your side

346
00:19:10.316 --> 00:19:13.110
But if you ask me to put down what I'm doing and go run the business

347
00:19:13.194 --> 00:19:14.570
That's not easy either

348
00:19:14.654 --> 00:19:16.989
So what should I do?

349
00:19:18.449 --> 00:19:21.452
You need populism now

350
00:19:21.535 --> 00:19:23.245
Not enough coffee and donuts?

351
00:19:23.329 --> 00:19:24.622
Of course not enough, Minister.

352
00:19:24.705 --> 00:19:27.500
We're not new recruits waiting for church to hand out snacks.

353
00:19:34.131 --> 00:19:35.591
ok

354
00:19:42.515 --> 00:19:43.683
Please help me, everyone.

355
00:19:43.766 --> 00:19:47.395
As long as you help me
I will definitely reward you with an excellent performance review

356
00:19:47.937 --> 00:19:52.316
Future Agent Kwon, Section Chief Zheng, and Deputy Chief Song

357
00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:55.236
I promise you will get what you want during your performance review

358
00:19:55.319 --> 00:19:56.612
Get ready for a promotion!

359
00:19:56.696 --> 00:19:57.780
- OK!
- OK!

360
00:19:57.863 --> 00:19:59.281
- Make achievements!
- Make achievements!

361
00:19:59.365 --> 00:20:01.033
- Get promoted together!
- Get promoted together!

362
00:20:01.117 --> 00:20:01.992
Do it again!

363
00:20:02.076 --> 00:20:03.577
- Make achievements!
- Make achievements!

364
00:20:03.661 --> 00:20:05.996
- Get promoted together!
- Get promoted together!

365
00:20:12.378 --> 00:20:13.546
I want to be a class principal!

366
00:20:21.679 --> 00:20:23.973
That Section Chief Song acted alone

367
00:20:24.056 --> 00:20:25.057
Chengjiu, come with me

368
00:20:25.141 --> 00:20:26.058
- OK
- Yes Minister

369
00:20:26.142 --> 00:20:28.310
Songxi is arranging the route. Let's leave quickly.

370
00:20:28.394 --> 00:20:29.603
- OK
- Do you still have a car?

371
00:20:29.687 --> 00:20:31.689
We didn't apply in advance, so there's only one car left.

372
00:20:31.772 --> 00:20:33.816
Then hurry up and apply. Don't let that car be snatched away.

373
00:20:33.899 --> 00:20:35.860
- I'll drive my own car
- OK

374
00:20:35.943 --> 00:20:37.403
I'm looking for a car

375
00:20:37.486 --> 00:20:39.196
- You go get the key.
- OK

376
00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:40.573
Hey wait!

377
00:20:40.656 --> 00:20:42.408
You have to tell me the license plate number

378
00:20:42.491 --> 00:20:43.492
7982

379
00:20:43.576 --> 00:20:44.994
Good 7982

380
00:20:45.077 --> 00:20:46.495
I'm leaving first

381
00:20:46.579 --> 00:20:48.247
OK, be careful on the road

382
00:20:49.415 --> 00:20:51.417
Good 7982

383
00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.545
Where is 7982?

384
00:20:57.089 --> 00:20:59.258
7982

385
00:21:00.134 --> 00:21:01.093
Where is it?

386
00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:10.352
wow

387
00:21:12.104 --> 00:21:13.397
(Seoul 32 DA7982)

388
00:21:13.481 --> 00:21:14.356
Minister Kim

389
00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:17.318
Judging from the key, the car must be very old.
Did you find it?

390
00:21:17.902 --> 00:21:18.861
here

391
00:21:19.612 --> 00:21:20.529
Where?

392
00:21:21.989 --> 00:21:23.073
This car

393
00:21:26.202 --> 00:21:27.787
Damn it

394
00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:28.829
Oh my god

395
00:21:29.371 --> 00:21:31.332
- wow
- Can the car still move?

396
00:21:32.208 --> 00:21:33.751
open the door

397
00:21:33.834 --> 00:21:34.877
Good

398
00:21:36.378 --> 00:21:37.630
wow

399
00:21:40.341 --> 00:21:42.676
The kilometers are less than I thought.

400
00:21:43.177 --> 00:21:44.053
Only 280,000?

401
00:21:44.136 --> 00:21:46.931
This car is too big for running business
So we rarely open

402
00:21:48.641 --> 00:21:49.850
Still a manual transmission?

403
00:21:49.934 --> 00:21:53.646
Why don't they get rid of this car?

404
00:21:53.729 --> 00:21:54.897
Shall I drive it?

405
00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:55.940
What?

406
00:21:56.023 --> 00:21:57.107
I'll do it

407
00:22:15.918 --> 00:22:17.461
Oh my god, the car can still run.

408
00:22:19.713 --> 00:22:21.006
I feel like this might be a good sign

409
00:22:42.695 --> 00:22:44.113
Executive Bai

410
00:22:44.196 --> 00:22:45.698
Hi

411
00:22:45.781 --> 00:22:46.782
Hello

412
00:22:48.742 --> 00:22:49.702
Where has everyone gone?

413
00:22:50.411 --> 00:22:52.830
They went on a field trip

414
00:22:52.913 --> 00:22:54.248
All three people went?

415
00:22:54.331 --> 00:22:55.374
Yes

416
00:22:56.250 --> 00:22:57.293
(Minister Kim Nak-soo)

417
00:22:57.376 --> 00:22:58.669
When can they come back?

418
00:22:58.752 --> 00:23:02.214
Well...let me ask

419
00:23:02.715 --> 00:23:03.883
No, it's okay

420
00:23:03.966 --> 00:23:05.259
good

421
00:23:07.720 --> 00:23:09.221
- Then keep working.
- OK

422
00:23:19.523 --> 00:23:20.441
Let me see

423
00:23:20.524 --> 00:23:22.067
Organize high-quality renewal customers into tables...

424
00:23:22.151 --> 00:23:23.193
(Contracted company)

425
00:23:23.277 --> 00:23:25.070
...sent to Section Chief Song

426
00:23:25.154 --> 00:23:26.071
(Route B, Section Chief Song)

427
00:23:27.740 --> 00:23:30.993
Companies unlikely to renew...

428
00:23:32.453 --> 00:23:33.787
(Route A: Minister Kim and Agent Jung)

429
00:23:33.871 --> 00:23:34.872
...just send it to Minister Kim

430
00:23:38.375 --> 00:23:40.169
He is the minister after all

431
00:23:40.252 --> 00:23:41.211
(Sales group chat)

432
00:23:41.295 --> 00:23:42.171
(Send files)

433
00:23:42.254 --> 00:23:43.631
Have you received the document from Songxi?

434
00:23:43.714 --> 00:23:44.882
Yes I received it

435
00:23:44.965 --> 00:23:48.218
We are going to start from Namyangju and go around in a clockwise direction

436
00:23:48.302 --> 00:23:50.554
You start from Bucheon and go through that area

437
00:23:50.638 --> 00:23:51.555
Yes Minister

438
00:23:51.639 --> 00:23:52.514
Thank you for your hard work

439
00:23:52.598 --> 00:23:53.766
See you tomorrow, Minister

440
00:23:53.849 --> 00:23:55.684
- OK
- all the best

441
00:23:56.644 --> 00:23:57.603
Good

442
00:23:57.686 --> 00:24:00.898
Wow, I drove this car for a few years when I was an agent.

443
00:24:00.981 --> 00:24:02.191
I haven’t opened it once since then.

444
00:24:02.274 --> 00:24:03.442
Really?

445
00:24:03.525 --> 00:24:06.153
This car is the same age as my son Soo-gyeom

446
00:24:06.236 --> 00:24:07.321
Isn’t it interesting?

447
00:24:07.404 --> 00:24:08.822
Soo Gyeom is already in college

448
00:24:10.407 --> 00:24:11.825
You look happy, Minister

449
00:24:12.826 --> 00:24:15.496
I haven’t felt so motivated at work in a long time.

450
00:24:16.288 --> 00:24:17.414
Let's go

451
00:24:17.498 --> 00:24:18.707
Let’s go!

452
00:24:25.130 --> 00:24:27.049
When drinking with superiors

453
00:24:27.132 --> 00:24:30.344
Turn your head and drink
This is polite in Korea

454
00:24:30.427 --> 00:24:32.680
Isn't that disrespectful?

455
00:24:33.555 --> 00:24:35.182
Doesn't that mean you are ignoring the other person?

456
00:24:36.433 --> 00:24:37.309
No

457
00:24:40.062 --> 00:24:42.314
- This is a cultural difference
- What?

458
00:24:54.576 --> 00:24:58.122
If you drink face to face
It means both parties have equal status

459
00:24:58.205 --> 00:25:00.499
But we think this is rude to our elders

460
00:25:01.417 --> 00:25:02.418
So

461
00:25:02.960 --> 00:25:07.256
We have to lower our heads or turn our heads to drink

462
00:25:07.339 --> 00:25:08.757
- Is that so?
- Right

463
00:25:10.718 --> 00:25:12.219
Have you decided yet?

464
00:25:20.310 --> 00:25:21.645
Let me help you break out of your shell

465
00:25:22.688 --> 00:25:26.025
Just like a bird breaking out of its shell, I will break it

466
00:25:26.108 --> 00:25:27.568
The shell of this company

467
00:25:28.736 --> 00:25:30.362
So that you can spread your wings and fly high

468
00:25:36.869 --> 00:25:37.786
(CDO Kim Soo-gyeom)

469
00:25:41.749 --> 00:25:43.208
welcome to the jungle

470
00:25:48.338 --> 00:25:49.465
Welcome to join brother

471
00:25:54.553 --> 00:25:56.430
(CDO Chief Disruption Officer Kim Soo-gyeom)

472
00:26:00.392 --> 00:26:02.352
Don't you think you've been thinking about it for too long?

473
00:26:03.312 --> 00:26:05.314
I'm not that casual person

474
00:26:09.318 --> 00:26:11.737
Your eyebrows are still the same as when you were a child

475
00:26:12.821 --> 00:26:14.073
What?

476
00:26:17.242 --> 00:26:18.118
You brought this too

477
00:26:18.202 --> 00:26:19.328
(ID card Kim Soo-gyeom)

478
00:26:19.411 --> 00:26:20.287
Yes

479
00:26:22.748 --> 00:26:23.916
Looking forward to your performance

480
00:26:25.959 --> 00:26:27.211
my chief saboteur

481
00:26:44.228 --> 00:26:45.896
Let's work

482
00:26:46.438 --> 00:26:47.314
(KEPCO KKE)

483
00:26:47.397 --> 00:26:48.649
I'm afraid this won't work

484
00:26:48.732 --> 00:26:50.818
We have cut our budget this year by 30%

485
00:26:50.901 --> 00:26:53.320
If you choose our low-cost maintenance package

486
00:26:53.403 --> 00:26:55.114
You don't need to replace any equipment

487
00:26:55.197 --> 00:26:56.365
Look here

488
00:26:56.448 --> 00:26:59.284
For a one-year contract, it only costs 890,000 won per month.

489
00:26:59.368 --> 00:27:01.495
You only need to pay an extra 150,000 won per month

490
00:27:01.578 --> 00:27:03.330
We can equip you with a dedicated security team

491
00:27:03.413 --> 00:27:06.500
This means we can respond in real time

492
00:27:06.583 --> 00:27:09.253
As soon as an external hacker attack occurs
We can block it immediately

493
00:27:09.336 --> 00:27:11.672
It can be said to be an iron wall!

494
00:27:19.763 --> 00:27:22.683
(energy drink)

495
00:27:24.560 --> 00:27:26.770
We will bear the entire cost of server replacement

496
00:27:27.312 --> 00:27:30.232
In addition, we will give you another 7% discount

497
00:27:30.858 --> 00:27:32.734
Wait, Minister?

498
00:27:32.818 --> 00:27:35.195
You are public officials serving your country.

499
00:27:35.279 --> 00:27:36.989
As a token of our gratitude, we offer a special offer

500
00:27:37.072 --> 00:27:38.574
go out

501
00:27:38.657 --> 00:27:41.410
I get angry when I hear ACT

502
00:27:41.493 --> 00:27:43.829
I promise to take care of the maintenance myself

503
00:27:43.912 --> 00:27:45.873
- Minister, let's go.
- Report for repairs in the middle of the night, I will be on call

504
00:27:45.956 --> 00:27:47.166
- Also on holidays
- let's go

505
00:27:47.249 --> 00:27:48.500
- let's go
- Really on call

506
00:27:48.584 --> 00:27:50.586
- Let's take our leave now.
- Same for Christmas Eve

507
00:27:50.669 --> 00:27:52.171
- What a waste of maintenance
- Please...

508
00:27:52.254 --> 00:27:53.630
Don't let me see you again!

509
00:27:53.714 --> 00:27:54.590
(Korea Telecom Development)

510
00:27:56.091 --> 00:27:57.217
- This...
- Sorry

511
00:27:57.843 --> 00:28:00.429
Hello everyone, I’m from ACT.

512
00:28:00.512 --> 00:28:01.847
Are you here to discuss contract renewal?

513
00:28:01.930 --> 00:28:03.390
- Right
- Sign it

514
00:28:03.473 --> 00:28:04.933
Then...

515
00:28:05.017 --> 00:28:05.893
good

516
00:28:06.727 --> 00:28:09.104
- Give me one to eat
- thank you

517
00:28:09.188 --> 00:28:10.814
- OK
- Are you ready?

518
00:28:10.898 --> 00:28:13.025
(service area)

519
00:28:20.324 --> 00:28:21.200
Minister Kim

520
00:28:21.742 --> 00:28:23.285
- thank you
- give

521
00:28:23.368 --> 00:28:24.244
Ouch

522
00:28:28.832 --> 00:28:29.917
So comfortable

523
00:28:32.878 --> 00:28:35.547
This is the first time I visit 20 customers in one day

524
00:28:35.631 --> 00:28:37.382
That's less than half

525
00:28:38.383 --> 00:28:41.303
Songxi seems to have given us the harder route

526
00:28:41.803 --> 00:28:42.888
Songxi is really...

527
00:28:48.393 --> 00:28:50.103
It's time for us to go back

528
00:28:51.063 --> 00:28:52.272
- Chengjiu
- Huh?

529
00:28:52.356 --> 00:28:54.149
Shall we stay nearby tonight?

530
00:28:54.233 --> 00:28:55.359
What?

531
00:28:56.318 --> 00:28:58.987
If I go back to Seoul, I'll come back tomorrow

532
00:28:59.071 --> 00:29:01.865
It must be tiring going back and forth

533
00:29:05.911 --> 00:29:09.498
Forget it, it's not the past anymore.

534
00:29:09.581 --> 00:29:10.457
let's go

535
00:29:10.540 --> 00:29:13.043
That's a great idea, Minister Kim.

536
00:29:13.126 --> 00:29:14.211
Huh?

537
00:29:14.878 --> 00:29:16.004
I'll drive this time

538
00:29:17.673 --> 00:29:19.174
Get in the car, Minister.

539
00:29:19.258 --> 00:29:21.218
- Are you sure?
- You must be tired.

540
00:29:26.598 --> 00:29:27.683
